    <item>
      <title>Anatoly Shilman</title>
      <link>https://mondaiycoffee.com/notes/2026-04-20-anatoly-shilman/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://mondaiycoffee.com/notes/2026-04-20-anatoly-shilman/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;pre-read&#34;&gt;Pre-Read&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://mondaiycoffee.com/members/anatoly-shilman/&#34;&gt;Toly Shilman&lt;/a&gt;, CEO and Co-Founder of &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.cogbias.ai/&#34;&gt;Cogbias AI &lt;/a&gt; is presenting. CogBias is building the decision integrity layer for enterprises and academia.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;about-cogbias-ai&#34;&gt;About Cogbias AI:&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://cogbias.ai/&#34;&gt;Cogbias&lt;/a&gt; AI helps revenue teams make better decisions by eliminating the cognitive biases that distort how they process information. We analyze AI outputs, research, sales conversations, and messaging to detect and correct biases — like confirmation bias and anchoring effects — before they influence how deals are won or lost. The result is cleaner, more reliable decision-making without replacing the tools teams already use.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Tanya Starchevsky</title>
      <link>https://mondaiycoffee.com/notes/2026-04-13-tanya-starchevsky/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 13 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://mondaiycoffee.com/notes/2026-04-13-tanya-starchevsky/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;presentation-time&#34;&gt;Presentation Time&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/in/tstarchevsky/&#34;&gt;Tanya&lt;/a&gt;, a product designer with almost 20 years of experience shared her experience trying out &lt;a href=&#34;https://stitch.withgoogle.com/&#34;&gt;Google Stitch&lt;/a&gt; . The short of presentation: impressive to get from 0 to 1 or to build out concepts, but when it came to making the small edits or tweaks that come to a design it became &lt;a href=&#34;https://youtu.be/NjNn4bbbgSw&#34;&gt;too cumbersome.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.pencil.dev/&#34;&gt;Pencil.dev&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.figma.com/&#34;&gt;Figma&lt;/a&gt; plus &lt;a href=&#34;https://help.figma.com/hc/en-us/articles/32132100833559-Guide-to-the-Figma-MCP-server&#34;&gt;MCP&lt;/a&gt; were also discussed.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;free-share&#34;&gt;Free Share&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A new attendee shared the video editing AI he&amp;rsquo;s working on, and we went on deep dive to the business and product of it all.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://mondaiycoffee.com/members/kolin-simon/&#34;&gt;Kolin&lt;/a&gt; ended the meeting leading a conversation on memory in the world of AI.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;next-week&#34;&gt;Next Week&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://mondaiycoffee.com/members/anatoly-shilman/&#34;&gt;Toly Shilman&lt;/a&gt; will share more about &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.cogbias.ai/&#34;&gt;CogBias AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
