    <item>
      <title>Pass the Aux Session</title>
      <link>https://mondaiycoffee.com/notes/2026-03-30-pass-the-aux/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 30 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://mondaiycoffee.com/notes/2026-03-30-pass-the-aux/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Sometimes we just pass the HDMI chord around folks share what they are working on at the momument.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This week, Olatomiwa Bifarin, Ph.D. shared his vision for the future of reading. (More or less) Ankush Tewari shared about some changes he made to the messaging of his site thanks to Gstack. He learned about Gstack thanks to Kolin Simon&amp;rsquo;s share during the meeting last week.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The compounding knowledge of learning from people who are building is amazing to see.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
